      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON GRANDEUR (2) found some support last start but struggled into fifth (22.44), beaten 6 lengths. Was in the money the start prior. Should be very hard to beat this time. ROMANI ROAD (3) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when fifth at Shepparton over 450m behind Just Breathe (25.65) in a Restricted WIN H. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. EXAGGERATOR (8) skirted wide from an outside draw last start and found the front, leading throughout to win (22.09) at Warrnambool in a Grade 5 over 390m. Boasts two wins from three starts out of this box. Significant danger. PAW RAMELLO (7) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
